PiliPlus Flutter interface and Windows runner
-------------------------------------------
PiliPlus contributors
https://github.com/bggRGjQaUbCoE/PiliPlus
Revision: d9e9626f1a3f89cd9ca85e18f61aaba02634e12a
License: GNU General Public License version 3; see windows/LICENSE.PiliPlus.

Sources adapted for XMPlus on 2026-11-04:
- lib/main.dart: application, localization and theme assembly
- lib/utils/theme_utils.dart: Material component themes
- lib/common/widgets/scroll_behavior.dart: desktop scrolling behavior
- lib/pages/main/view.dart: Material navigation rail and navigation bar
- lib/pages/setting/view.dart: wide/narrow settings layout
- lib/utils/config_archive.dart: split-file backup ZIP metadata structure
- lib/pages/login/geetest/geetest_webview_dialog.dart: Windows WebView interaction pattern
- windows/CMakeLists.txt and windows/flutter/CMakeLists.txt: Windows build rules
- windows/runner/: native Flutter host, utilities, resource and manifest files
- windows/.gitignore: generated Windows build-file exclusions
- lib/utils/update.dart and lib/pages/about/view.dart: release check, update dialog
  and platform-specific download selection, adapted to XMPlus GitHub releases
- .github/workflows/build.yml: Android split-ABI signing and release workflow pattern

The adapted Windows runner uses the XMPlus binary and display name, an original
white artistic X on a bright red circle, and a 1280 x 800 initial window.
PiliPlus app-link forwarding and branding are not included. The
disabled Impeller setting is retained and the first-frame Show callback is
restored. No PiliPlus icon, installer or packaging files are incorporated.
The interface is adapted for audio navigation without Bilibili services.
